ull whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit"> | Teknik Analiz

XU100’de kırmızı kutunun yukarı yönlü kırılımının pariteyi ve yatırımcısının bir nebze rahatlayabileceğini düşünüyorum.

Fiyata yakın olan yeşil kutunun kaybı ise fiyatta dengesiz yükseliş sırasında bıraktığı Actual Gap’ini önemini arttıracaktır. Bir diğer</span><button type="button" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-blue-500 text-[length:inherit] font-normal"> Show more</button></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto relative overflow-hidden aspect-video"><div class="grid h-full w-full grid-cols-2 gap-0.5"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/Efloud/status/1978791906231320778/photo/1"><img alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" width="3286" height="1770" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G3YSru2WMAAcyhM?format=webp&amp;name=small" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G3YSru2WMAAcyhM?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G3YSru2WMAAcyhM?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G3YSru2WMAAcyhM?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 50vw, 300px"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/Efloud/status/1978791906231320778/photo/1"></a></div></div><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/Efloud/status/1978791906231320778/photo/2"><img alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" width="3286" height="1770" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G3YSsl8WUAA3teR?format=webp&amp;name=small" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G3YSsl8WUAA3teR?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G3YSsl8WUAA3teR?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G3YSsl8WUAA3teR?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 50vw, 300px